    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<style>*{overflow-wrap: break-word;} img {max-width:100% !important} </style><style type=\"text/css\">*{overflow-wrap: break-word;} img {max-width:100% !important}\r\n</style>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">&bull; सही सुमेलन है- </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">संघीय संविधान समिति &ndash; जवाहरलाल नेहरू; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">प्रक्रिया नियम समिति &ndash; डॉ. राजेंद्र प्रसाद; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">प्रारूप समिति &ndash; डॉ. बी. आर. अंबेडकर; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">मौलिक अधिकार उप-समिति &ndash; जे. बी. कृपलानी।</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>&bull; The correct matching is: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Union Constitution Committee &ndash; Jawaharlal Nehru; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Committee on Rules of Procedure &ndash; Dr. Rajendra Prasad; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Drafting Committee &ndash; Dr. B.R. Ambedkar; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Fundamental Rights Sub-Committee &ndash; J.B. Kripalani.</span></p>",
